36\nThere is no in-between.\n\n1315\n01:19:11,163 --> 01:19:14,875\nSo you plan to wage war\non the entire world,\n\n1316\n01:19:15,459 --> 01:19:17,795\nand you want Wakanda\nto help you?\n\n1317\n01:19:18,712 --> 01:19:19,880\nThat's madness.\n\n1318\n01:19:20,047 --> 01:19:23,050\nThere isn't a nation\nthat wouldn't plunder Wakanda\n\n1319\n01:19:23,133 --> 01:19:24,677\nif given a chance.\n\n1320\n01:19:26,011 --> 01:19:27,930\nIf we make an alliance,\n\n1321\n01:19:28,097 --> 01:19:30,808\nwe can protect each other\nby striking them first.\n\n1322\n01:19:31,350 --> 01:19:35,604\nThen, when the threat of these\nnations has been eliminated,\n\n1323\n01:19:35,771 --> 01:19:38,399\nthe scientist will be returned\nto Wakanda.\n\n1324\n01:19:38,816 --> 01:19:41,610\nAnd if Wakanda\ndoes not accept, what then?\n\n1325\n01:19:42,695 --> 01:19:44,655\nThe scientist will die.\n\n1326\n01:19:45,656 --> 01:19:48,575\nAnd Wakanda will be\nthe first nation to fall.\n\n1327\n01:19:48,826 --> 01:19:50,369\nAn attack on my people?\n\n1328\n01:19:50,703 --> 01:19:52,162\nYes.\n\n1329\n01:19:52,329 --> 01:19:54,707\nAnd I want you\nto listen to me.\n\n1330\n01:19:54,873 --> 01:19:57,835\nWakanda cannot win a war\n"}}
